"description": "Chambal Fertilisers & Chemicals Ltd. is a holding company, which engages in the manufacture and sale of fertilizer products. It operates through the following segments: Own Manufactured Fertilizers, Complex Fertilizers, Crop Protection Chemicals and Speciality Nutrients, and Others. The Own Manufactured Fertilisers segment includes the manufacture and marketing of Urea. The Complex Fertilisers segment refers to the purchase and sale of DAP, MOP and various grades of NPK fertilisers. The Crop Protection Chemicals and Speciality Nutrients segment deals with the purchase and sale of crop protection chemicals and speciality nutrients. The Others segment involves the upcoming Technical Ammonium Nitrate Plant and others. The company was founded by Krishna Kumar Birla on May 7, 1985 and is headquartered in New Delhi, India.",
